ong>Town government</strong><span class="t">None</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M16 10h4a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-4l-4 7H9l2-7H7l-2 2H3l2-4-2-4h2l2 2h4L9 3h3z"/></svg></span><span><strong>Airport</strong><span class="t">20 min drive</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 11.5 12 3.5l9 8M5.5 10v10.5h13V10M10 20.5V15h4v5.5"/></svg></span><span><strong>Ocean-side condo</strong><span class="t">About $320,000</span></span></li></ul></div><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated June 12, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">No town government, two counties, a 668-foot pier, and homes from inland condos to houses on the marsh.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Garden City, South Carolina is a beach community with no town government, between Surfside Beach and Murrells Inlet. Its beach road, Waccamaw Drive, runs about 5 miles with the ocean on one side and salt marsh on the other, and most of it is in Georgetown County, not Horry.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">No town rental ordinance applies, because there is no town. Horry County's list of filings for a nightly rental names no rental permit, and each condo building's own rules decide the rest.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Tell us how you will use it. We send the Garden City homes that fit.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Send me Garden City homes</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory);padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:0;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#where" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Where it is</a></li><li><a href="#parts" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Five parts</a></li><li><a href="#prices" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Home prices</a></li><li><a href="#airbnb" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Renting it out</a></li><li><a href="#normal-week" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">A normal week</a></li><li><a href="#flooding" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-h