24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>It depends most on the home's size, location and how it's run. The middle half of Garden City Beach listings earn between $1,930 and $5,870 in a typical month, and the top tenth $10,700 or more. For one home, enter its address and bedroom count in the <a href="/calculator" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Airbnb income calculator</a>: it compares the home with similar listings nearby.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>What is the average Airbnb occupancy rate in Garden City Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Listings in Garden City Beach were booked on 40% of available nights over the past year. That compares with 39% for the South Carolina average. July is usually the busiest month.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How much does an Airbnb cost per night in Garden City Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>The average booked night in Garden City Beach cost $371 before fees. Half of listings charge between $205 and $420, so bedroom count and location move the price more than the average suggests.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>Do you need a permit for an Airbnb in Garden City Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>None of the active Garden City Beach listings display a registration, permit or license number. That doesn't mean no rules apply, so confirm registration, permit and occupancy-tax rules with the city or county before buying.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>Is Airbnb profitable in Garden City Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Yes, when it's run well. The average Garden City Beach Airbnb grossed $41,223 in the 12 months to September 2026, 10% above the South Carolina average of $37,525. Run by its owner, with the cleaning fee covering the cleaner and everyday costs for Airbnb's fee, utilities, supplies, upkeep and insurance, $25,333 a year (about $2,110 a month) is left before the mortgage or rent. A home that costs less than that to own or rent makes a profit, and a listing at the top-quarter mark leaves about $3,610 a month. Check a specific home in the <a href="/calculator" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Airbnb calculator</a>.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>When is Airbnb peak season in Garden City Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>July usually pays best, averaging $10,200 per active listing over the past two years, and January usually pays least. The month-by-month table above shows how the latest 12 months played out.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>What is the Airbnb RevPAR in Garden City Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Each night a Garden City Beach listing was open to book earned $159 on average over the past year, booked or not. That figure, revenue per available night (RevPAR), folds price and occupancy into one number; the top 10% of listings made $331 or more.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How far in advance do guests book Airbnbs in Garden City Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Garden City Beach stays were booked 73 days (about two and a half months) before arrival on average over the past year, so a listing that opens its calendar late misses many bookings.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How long do guests stay at Airbnbs in Garden City Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>The average Garden City Beach Airbnb stay lasted 5.1 nights over the past year. A listing took 21 reservations over the year on average.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How are Airbnbs in Garden City Beach rated?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Guests rate Garden City Beach Airbnbs 4.80 out of 5 on average. Guests score location highest and cleanliness lowest.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>What are the best neighborhoods for Airbnb in Garden City Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>Garden City Beach and Georgetown draw the most short-term rental interest in Garden City Beach. The <a href="#neighborhoods" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">neighborhood guide</a> explains what brings guests to each.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How many Airbnbs are there in Garden City Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>AirROI counted 374 active Airbnb listings in Garden City Beach as of September 2026. The closest tracked market is <a href="/airbnb-data/united-states/south-carolina/murrells-inlet" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Murrells Inlet</a>, 3 km away.</p> </div> </details><details class="group border-b border-[#e0e0e0] !border-[#e0e0e0]"> <summary class="flex min-h-[56px] cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 py-3 text-[17px] font-bold leading-snug text-[#1e293b]"> <span>How much are Airbnb cleaning fees in Garden City Beach?</span> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.54)] transition group-open:rotate-180" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="tabler:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:tabler:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="mg-prose pb-5 [&_p]:!text-[16.5px]"> <p>In Garden City Beach, nearly all listings add a cleaning fee. The median fee is $230, and some higher fees lift the average to $314.</p> </div> </details> </div> </section><section id="about-data" class="mg-section mg-col"> <div class="mg-title mb-8"> <p class="font-lato text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-[rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]"> Method </p> <h2 class="mg-serif mt-1.5 text-[30px] font-bold leading-[1.12] sm:text-[36px] tracking-[-0.012em] text-[#1e293b]"> About This Data </h2>  </div> <div class="mg-report prose max-w-none">  <div class="space-y-4"> <p id="about-data-summary">
