+			&mdash; Andrew Dockery (@AndrewWMBF) <a href="https://twitter.com/AndrewWMBF/status/1575883683390803968?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw">September 30, 2022</a></blockquote>
+			<script async src="https://platform.twitter.com/widgets.js" charset="utf-8"></script></td>
